              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M9",
            "speaker_id": 46183,
            "reply_to": "M3",
            "text": "Okay, let's summarize to lock this in. We're moving forward with 3 tiers. The core benefits are approved with the change to Tier 3's consulting hours. That's D1. For pricing, we're increasing Tier 2 by 15% and adding a 10% annual discount. That's D2. Everyone aligned?",
            "mentions": [
              52934,
