      {
        "thread_id": "TH2",
        "thread_goal": "Finalize sales script, objection handling, and pre-call checklist.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M14",
            "speaker_id": 488135,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi all, as part of T3 and T7, I've created a first draft of the sales script (A2) and the objection-handling cheat sheet (A3). They are in the project folder. Feedback is welcome!",
            "mentions": [
              46183,
              52934,
              54019,
              31942
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T3",
              "T7",
              "A2",
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M15",
            "speaker_id": 46183,
            "reply_to": "M14",
            "text": "Thanks @488135. This is a solid start. For A3, the response to 'I need to talk to my boss' is a bit weak. We should pivot to providing them with a one-pager they can share internally, highlighting the key ROI points. Also, we should create a pre-call checklist (A7) to ensure we're prepared for each conversation. I can take a stab at drafting A7.",
            "mentions": [
              488135
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3",
              "A7"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "bulb",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M16",
            "speaker_id": 52934,
            "reply_to": "M15",
            "text": "I agree. A checklist A7 is a great idea. For the script A2, the opening feels a little generic. We could make it more impactful by leading with a specific insight relevant to their industry. For example: 'I'm calling because we've helped other companies in your sector achieve X'. It builds credibility faster.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2",
              "A7"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M17",
            "speaker_id": 54019,
            "reply_to": "M14",
            "text": "Looks good. In the script, can we make sure to mention all the features for each tier?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M18",
            "speaker_id": 46183,
            "reply_to": "M17",
            "text": "Good point, but we should focus on the 2-3 benefits most relevant to the customer's needs we uncover during discovery, rather than listing everything. The goal of the script A2 is a conversation, not a monologue. We can have the full list handy for reference.",
            "mentions": [
              54019
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M19",
            "speaker_id": 31942,
            "reply_to": "M14",
            "text": "For the objection about price, can I offer them a discount to close the deal?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M20",
            "speaker_id": 52934,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "@31942 We need to be consistent. The only discount we should mention is the 10% for annual prepayment we decided on in TH1. Let's stick to the approved responses in A3 to maintain the value of our offering.",
            "mentions": [
              31942
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M21",
            "speaker_id": 488135,
            "reply_to": "M15",
            "text": "These are all great points. I'll update A2 and A3 with the suggested changes.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2",
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M22",
            "speaker_id": 46183,
            "reply_to": "M21",
            "text": "Great. I've just uploaded the draft for the pre-call checklist A7. With the updates to A2 and A3, I think we'll be ready to lock these in. Let's make a final decision: we approve the updated script and objection list. This covers D3 and D4. Are we all in agreement?",
            "mentions": [
              52934,
              488135,
              54019,
              31942
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A7",
              "A2",
              "A3"
            ],
