      {
        "thread_id": "TH3",
        "thread_goal": "Define target segments, outreach cadence, and prospect list priorities.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M26",
            "speaker_id": 52934,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, let's start on T4 and T5. To build our prospect list, we need to define our initial target segments. I propose we focus on three groups for the first few weeks: 1) Customers whose contracts are up for renewal in the next 60 days, 2) High-engagement users on our free plan, and 3) Former customers who left for a competitor.",
            "mentions": [
              46183,
              488135,
              31942,
              54019
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T4",
              "T5"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "dart",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M27",
            "speaker_id": 46183,
            "reply_to": "M26",
            "text": "That's a sharp list. The 'high-engagement free users' are likely our warmest leads. I suggest we make them priority #1. For the outreach cadence (T5), I've drafted a proposal in A6. It's a 6-touch sequence over 15 days, mixing calls and emails. This should be effective without overwhelming them.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T5",
              "A6"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M28",
            "speaker_id": 488135,
            "reply_to": "M27",
            "text": "The cadence in A6 looks solid. I can start pulling a list of the high-engagement users and adding them to our tracking sheet A4.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A6",
              "A4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M29",
            "speaker_id": 54019,
            "reply_to": "M27",
            "text": "Should we also use social media to contact them?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M30",
            "speaker_id": 52934,
            "reply_to": "M29",
            "text": "Let's stick to email and calls for the initial launch as defined in A6. We can test other channels later once we have a baseline for performance. It's better to do two channels well than four channels poorly.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A6"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M31",
            "speaker_id": 31942,
            "reply_to": "M28",
            "text": "I will add some names to A4 too.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M32",
            "speaker_id": 46183,
            "reply_to": "M26",
            "text": "Okay, let's formalize this. We're selecting the three proposed customer segments as our priority for the first 3 weeks. That's D5. And we're approving the outreach cadence documented in A6. That's D6. Everyone on board?",
            "mentions": [
              52934,
              488135,
              54019,
              31942
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A6"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D5",
              "D6"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "white_check_mark",
                "count": 4
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M33",
            "speaker_id": 52934,
            "reply_to": "M32",
            "text": "Confirmed.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M34",
            "speaker_id": 488135,
            "reply_to": "M32",
            "text": "Yes, sounds like a plan.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M35",
            "speaker_id": 488135,
            "reply_to": "M31",
            "text": "Hey @31942, thanks for adding those contacts to A4. Could you also fill in the 'Last Activity Date' column? It helps us prioritize the outreach.",
            "mentions": [
              31942
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          }
