      {
        "thread_id": "TH5",
        "thread_goal": "Agree on reporting format and weekly update ritual for membership performance.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M46",
            "speaker_id": 54019,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hello team, for tasks T8 and T12, I have set up the performance tracking sheet A4 and a draft of the weekly summary template A8. Please let me know your thoughts.",
            "mentions": [
              46183,
              52934,
              488135,
              31942
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T8",
              "T12",
              "A4",
              "A8"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M47",
            "speaker_id": 31942,
            "reply_to": "M46",
            "text": "What is 'conversion rate'?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M48",
            "speaker_id": 488135,
            "reply_to": "M47",
            "text": "@31942 It's the percentage of prospects we talk to who sign up for a membership.",
            "mentions": [
              31942
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M49",
            "speaker_id": 46183,
            "reply_to": "M46",
            "text": "Thanks @54019. The tracking sheet A4 looks good. For the summary template A8, I think we can make it more visual and less dense. I'd suggest focusing on three headline metrics at the top: 'Leads Contacted', 'New Memberships Sold', and 'Total Revenue'. I've sketched out a revised A8 and put it in the folder. Also, let's establish a clear rhythm: everyone updates their data in A4 by EOD Thursday, and one person posts the summary from A8 here every Friday AM.",
            "mentions": [
              54019
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A4",
              "A8"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "bulb",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M50",
            "speaker_id": 52934,
            "reply_to": "M49",
            "text": "That's a much cleaner format for A8. It tells the story at a glance. Adding 'Conversion Rate by Segment' would also be powerful to see which of our target audiences is responding best. The weekly cadence sounds perfect.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A8"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
